          "question": "e-132",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "Which of the following functions are differentiable at the point $x=-1?$\n\n- $f(x) = x^5+1$\n\n- $g(x) = \\dfrac{2}{x+1}$",
